  - sectionType: 0
    knotName: what_is_localization
    entries:
    - type: 0
      text: Localization is the process of adapting your game for different regions,
        cultures, and languages. This involves translating text, adjusting date formats,
        adapting graphics, and sometimes even changing gameplay elements to better
        suit the target audience.
      targetKnot: 
      choiceDepth: 1
      stickyChoice: 0
      suppressChoiceText: 0
      fallbackChoice: 0
      choiceConditionExpression: 
      gatherDepth: 1
      conditionExpression: isCoop
      elseTargetKnot: 
      rawInk: 
      tags:
        useSpeaker: 0
        speakerId: 
        speakerName: 
        portraitKey: 
        speakerAnimation: 
        useLocale: 1
        localeKey: what_is_localization1
        useLayout: 0
        layoutAnimation: 
        useAudio: 0
        audioId: 
        customTags: []
      expanded: 1
    - type: 0
      text: Localization is crucial for reaching a global audience and ensuring your
        game is accessible to players from diverse backgrounds.
      targetKnot: 
      choiceDepth: 1
      stickyChoice: 0
      suppressChoiceText: 0
      fallbackChoice: 0
      choiceConditionExpression: 
      gatherDepth: 1
      conditionExpression: isCoop
      elseTargetKnot: 
      rawInk: 
      tags:
        useSpeaker: 0
        speakerId: 
        speakerName: 
        portraitKey: 
        speakerAnimation: 
        useLocale: 1
        localeKey: what_is_localization2
        useLayout: 0
        layoutAnimation: 
        useAudio: 0
        audioId: 
        customTags: []
      expanded: 1
